  "walkthrough": [
    "`user-message` is published on `main` from outside the network; `researcher` and `critic` each receive a copy.",
    "`researcher` receives it and emits `finding` on `drafts`, a channel declared for `finding` and `critique`; `editor` picks it up.",
    "In response to `user-message`, `critic` emits `critique` on `drafts`; `editor` takes it from there.",
    "`editor` receives it and emits `report` on `client`, a channel that only carries `report`; no agent subscribes to `client`, so `report` leaves the network through its `sse` proxy and, as a terminal event, ends the run.",
    "The runtime then publishes `m4trix:run.completed` on every channel (`main`, `drafts` and `client`) to close the run."
  ]
